      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "On October 5, 1877, Chief Joseph surrendered at Zurich after a 1,300‑mile retreat, marking the end of the Nez Perce war.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
